+/* Cosmopolitan Libc platform glue for libuv (haxe-in-haxe, hxc/tools/cosmo-deps.sh).
+ *
+ * One Cosmopolitan binary runs on Linux, macOS, Windows and the BSDs, so
+ * libuv is built with its generic unix backend: poll(2) for I/O
+ * (posix-poll.c), no file system events (no-fsevents.c), getifaddrs for
+ * interfaces (bsd-ifaddrs.c), sysinfo for memory and load (sysinfo-*.c).
+ * This file has the rest of the per-platform functions, and the run-time
+ * translation of system errors to libuv's fixed error codes (uv/errno.h).
